      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I support this as far as kicking, but I don't support world bans. That's too much power for people who will use it capriciously.\nRec Room uses a world ban system, and my experience of it was that it was a great way to cause tension, drama, and feuds.\nEdit: I think gallium's comment offers a good compromise. World bans from public instances make a lot more sense.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
