  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-06-02T01:33:07.120Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A world creator should be able to give any players they want the same abilities they have to kick other players from any world they have created. I think this would be a great way to combat toxic public worlds.\nIn addition I would say the world creator moderation powers should allow them to \"world ban\" anyone. The world creator and world deputy mods should be able to ban someone from ever returning to that world on their account",
